\b FS Platform Model Handover V1.0.4 \b0\par
\par
\b Version Positioning \b0\par
V1.0.4 is a continuous upgrade on top of V1.0.3a. It does not rebuild the project, does not rewrite the solver core, and does not enter V1.5 or V2.0.\par
\par
\b Core Additions \b0\par
1. Front and rear spring sweep pass/fail maps.\par
2. aeroPlatformPass, scrapePassQuasiStatic, and scrapePassBumpAdjusted.\par
3. caseDef.bumpAdjust.enable, reserveFront, reserveRear, notes.\par
4. hDynamicAllBumpAdjusted, hDynamicMinBumpAdjusted, dynamicClearanceBumpAdjustedPass.\par
5. Quasi-static and bump-adjusted four-class maps.\par
\par
\b Pass Definitions \b0\par
aeroPlatformPass = aeroLossPass && frontShareMigrationPass\par
scrapePassQuasiStatic = staticGroundClearancePass && dynamicClearancePass && ~clearanceViolation\par
scrapePassBumpAdjusted = staticGroundClearancePass && dynamicClearanceBumpAdjustedPass && ~bumpAdjustedClearanceViolation\par
\par
\b Bump-Adjusted Boundary \b0\par
The bump-adjusted feature is only a conservative correction applied on quasi-static dynamic clearance for scrape robustness screening. It is not a full transient bump model and does not add new states or time-domain dynamics.\par
\par
